      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Attack and Defense Rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,892,917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Combat rolls follow the same\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,917,946]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "procedure. The target number that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,946,980]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you must roll to hit or defend from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,980,1016]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an opponent is the opponent’s L.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1016,1049]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You fight an L3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1049,1074]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombie. On your turn, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1074,1100]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "can hit the zombie by rolling\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1100,1130]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a 3+ on d6. On the zombie’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1130,1158]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turn, you dodge its attacks by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1158,1189]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-attack-and-defense-rolls:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling a 3+ on d6.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[8,1189,1209]]"
    }
  ],
